  {
   "key": "1789912111033716740",
   "en": "Yeah?",
   "ro": "Da?"
  },
  {
   "key": "1789912111084048388",
   "en": "What the...? When I gotta be there...? Uh-huh... sure...",
   "ro": "Ce naiba...? Când trebuie să fiu acolo...? Aha... sigur..."
  },
  {
   "key": "1789912111100825604",
   "en": "Yeah, done it before... Yep, car's free... Mhm... yeah...",
